\newlabel{fig:distance_filter}{{5}{8}{Effect of the minimum body-distance filter on measured signal classification at 99\% confidence. Increasing the exclusion of near-body vortices strengthened the association between measured pressure signals and fish-shaped digital twin}{figure.5}{}}
